<name>CAN Communication</name>
<ttl id="10033_S0007_741KB_T000K" variety="T000K">
<name>CAN Communication System</name>
<para id="RM0000030KV001X" category="C" type-id="803AT" name-id="95100-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>U1101</dtccode>
<dtcname>Driving Support ECU Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000030KV001X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE400000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.60in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U1101</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>With the IG ON, the CAN gateway ECU cannot receive data from the ACC ECU</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Distance control computer (ACC ECU) branch line open or connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance control computer (ACC ECU) power source system malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance control computer (ACC ECU) internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000030KV001X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE500000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B180471J03" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000030KV001X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE600000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The following flowchart applies only when output by the CAN gateway ECU (V bus No.2 monitoring ECU). If an ECU other than the CAN gateway ECU outputs this code, it is necessary to identify the malfunctioning area using 'How to Proceed with Troubleshooting'.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When measuring the resistance of the CAN bus, turn the IG OFF, confirm that warning functions such as the key reminder warning system are not operating, and leave the vehicle for 1 minutes or more without operating the key or switches or opening/closing the doors before starting measurement. If it is necessary to open a door during inspection, open it beforehand.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When inspecting each connector, before disconnecting it, push the connector case in the connecting direction and check that the connector is not loose or disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When disconnecting a connector, check that the connector terminals and connector case are free of damage, deformation, corrosion, etc.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000030KV001X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE700000">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN gateway ECU does not output code U1002</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN gateway ECU outputs code U1002</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0007" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE800000">
<testtitle>Check CAN Bus for Open Circuit (ACC ECU Branch Wire)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the distance control computer assembly (ACC ECU) vehicle harness connector from the distance control computer assembly (ACC ECU).</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147877J04" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the distance control computer assembly (ACC ECU) vehicle harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.94in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.95in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Measurement Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>8(CANH) - 9(CANL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>54 to 69Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0005" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CE900000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (ECU Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect between each terminal of the distance control computer assembly (ACC ECU) vehicle harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C147877J05" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.94in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.95in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Measurement Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 (B) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.94in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.95in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Measurement Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>12 (GND) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0004" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000030KV001X_04_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0004">
<testtitle>Go to Radar Cruise Control System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064400KX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0005">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Branch Wire or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0006">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000030KV001X_04_0007">
<testtitle>Go to the relevant flowchart<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001LYP00CX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
